  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758871,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1 Year Demo for Commodore 64: A Blast from the Past!\n\nRelive the intensity of World War II in *1 Year Demo*, a thrilling vertical-scrolling shooter for the Commodore 64! Inspired by the classic *1942*, this demo puts you in the cockpit of a Lockheed P-38 Lightning, soaring over the Pacific's island chain. Engage in frantic dogfights against relentless waves of Japanese aircraft, battling for supremacy in the skies.\n\nExperience fast-paced, arcade-style action as you collect power-ups to enhance your firepower and execute daring defensive loop maneuvers to evade enemy fire – but be warned, you only have three lives! A strategic map displayed on the left side of the screen keeps track of your progress through the challenging levels. \n\n*1 Year Demo* captures the spirit of classic shoot 'em ups with vibrant graphics and a pulse-pounding soundtrack, offering a taste of what a full game could become. Prepare for a nostalgic trip back to the golden age of gaming!"
    },
